<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>A Red Light Situation</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Not Advised</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">After the Fight</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6wmycZD3N3DeMVdhiDv9b1</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">2 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A Red Light Situation Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Verse 1: Well you can take it or leave it, either way its fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And i'd love to say we care but we got better things in mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Well you can fake it or mean it, just look me in the eye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And tell me honestly how you are worthy of our time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chorus: This is our situation, and we're happy to be here</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wouldn't change this place for anything x2</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Verse 2: Sometimes wish i could turn back time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Soften up and draw a line</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And see you cross it, unaware of whats on the other side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Well we'll be waitin, to shrug off every lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your lips are spillin, we'll catch you every time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We'll catch you everytime</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chorus: This is our situation, and we're happy to be here</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wouldn't change this place for anything x2</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Verse 3: Well it's a long way up in this feather town</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gonna touch the sky before i hit the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Well it's a long way up in this feather town</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm gonna touch the sky...</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Chorus: This is our situation, and we're happy to be here</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wouldn't change this place for anything x3</p></div></body></tt>